# Settings > System > Strokes training (report 042, PDA phase S6) on the profile pda: the page keeps the writing zone's
# band shown (its writing boxes) and takes its strokes. The first glyph is b (the letters refused at the owner's first
# board test come first): its shape as a guide (light ink, a green dot where it starts), "Draw b (1/4)". Attempts written
# in the letters box: a lower-case b (recognised: green), a d (read as d: amber), a scribble (refused: red); a fourth b
# ends the glyph: its templates go to the user overlay (out/<WxH>/runtime/config, strokesuser), the tables are loaded
# again, the page moves on to p; every attempt is in the capture log. Pick opens the glyph picker (section 12: b amber,
# hard: 2 of 4 recognised); e picked and written four times comes back green; the Reset all dialog, cancelled; Finish
# starts the re-test (b and e once more), then the summary: the glyphs that improved least first.
# Goldens at both sizes.
title strokes training
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
strokesuser
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 21:04 2026-10-25
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
key UP
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
expect_zone writing
expect_text "Draw b  (1/4)"
shot strokes_training
stroke letters 60,20 60,45 60,70 60,95 60,120 60,105 60,90 61,78 66,70 75,64 87,62 100,64 111,70 118,80 121,92 119,104 113,113 102,119 88,120 74,119 64,117
stroke letters 60,30 60,117 61,111 61,104 62,95 62,90 63,84 64,78 64,73 65,64 67,57 69,51 72,45 76,42 82,40 87,41 94,41 101,43 106,45 111,48 115,52 119,56 121,62 122,67 123,73 124,80 124,88 124,96 123,103 122,109 120,114 116,119 110,123 105,125 100,126 94,128 89,129 82,129 75,129 69,130 63,130
stroke letters 40,40 120,45 43,100 130,110 50,44
expect_text "Draw b  (4/4)"
shot strokes_training_attempts
stroke letters 60,20 60,45 60,70 60,95 60,120 60,105 60,90 61,78 66,70 75,64 87,62 100,64 111,70 118,80 121,92 119,104 113,113 102,119 88,120 74,119 64,117
expect_text "Draw p  (1/4)"
expect_file strokes-user.txt has "# strokes-training b letters: 4 written, 2 recognised"
expect_file strokes-training.txt lines 4
shot strokes_training_next
tapbutton Pick
expect_text "Pick a glyph"
expect_zone writing
shot strokes_training_picker
tapbutton e
expect_text "Draw e  (1/4)"
stroke letters 109,39 105,34 101,30 96,27 90,25 84,25 77,26 70,27 65,28 59,32 55,36 53,41 52,47 52,53 53,59 57,63 62,66 68,68 74,69 80,70 86,72 88,72 82,73 77,74 70,75 62,76 58,79 54,83 52,89 51,95 50,100 50,105 52,112 56,118 62,122 66,124 72,125 78,125 84,125 90,124 96,121 102,117 106,113 111,109 114,105 120,99
stroke letters 109,39 105,34 101,30 96,27 90,25 84,25 77,26 70,27 65,28 59,32 55,36 53,41 52,47 52,53 53,59 57,63 62,66 68,68 74,69 80,70 86,72 88,72 82,73 77,74 70,75 62,76 58,79 54,83 52,89 51,95 50,100 50,105 52,112 56,118 62,122 66,124 72,125 78,125 84,125 90,124 96,121 102,117 106,113 111,109 114,105 120,99
stroke letters 109,39 105,34 101,30 96,27 90,25 84,25 77,26 70,27 65,28 59,32 55,36 53,41 52,47 52,53 53,59 57,63 62,66 68,68 74,69 80,70 86,72 88,72 82,73 77,74 70,75 62,76 58,79 54,83 52,89 51,95 50,100 50,105 52,112 56,118 62,122 66,124 72,125 78,125 84,125 90,124 96,121 102,117 106,113 111,109 114,105 120,99
stroke letters 109,39 105,34 101,30 96,27 90,25 84,25 77,26 70,27 65,28 59,32 55,36 53,41 52,47 52,53 53,59 57,63 62,66 68,68 74,69 80,70 86,72 88,72 82,73 77,74 70,75 62,76 58,79 54,83 52,89 51,95 50,100 50,105 52,112 56,118 62,122 66,124 72,125 78,125 84,125 90,124 96,121 102,117 106,113 111,109 114,105 120,99
expect_text "Pick a glyph"
